    "title": "Arts center screening 'Love + War' tonight",
    "text": "A film presented by Newport- FILM that explores journalism, motherhood and the sacrifices of the truth will be screened at 7 p.m. Thursday, Oct. 16, at the Jamestown Arts Center, 18 Valley St.\nThe documentary, “Love + War,” tells the story of Pulitzer Prizewinning photojournalist Lynsey Addario, whose assignments have taken her to war zones from Afghanistan to Ukraine. Admission is $25 through newportfilm.com.",
